# torch_npu 自定义内存池 (NPUPluggableAllocator) 机制分析

## 1. 概述

torch_npu 提供了 `NPUPluggableAllocator` 机制，允许用户使用自定义的内存分配器替换默认的 `NPUCachingAllocator`。本文档详细分析该机制的实现原理、调用路径以及存在的问题。

## 2. 核心架构

### 2.1 分配器层次结构

```
NPUAllocator (抽象接口)
├── NpuCachingAllocator (默认实现)
│   └── DeviceCachingAllocator
│       ├── BlockPool
│       └── Block
└── NPUPluggableAllocator (自定义分配器包装)
    └── 用户提供的函数指针
        ├── alloc_fn_
        ├── free_fn_
        ├── record_stream_fn_ (可选)
        └── erase_stream_fn_ (可选)
```

### 2.2 全局分配器切换机制

```cpp
// NPUCachingAllocator.h
namespace c10_npu::NPUCachingAllocator {
    // 全局分配器指针 - 所有内存操作都通过它分发
    C10_NPU_API extern std::atomic<NPUAllocator*> allocator;

    inline NPUAllocator* get() {
        return allocator.load();
    }
}

// NPUCachingAllocator.cpp - 默认初始化
struct BackendStaticInitializer {
    BackendStaticInitializer() {
        allocator.store(&caching_allocator);  // 默认使用 NpuCachingAllocator
    }
};

// NPUPluggableAllocator.cpp - 切换到自定义分配器
void changeCurrentAllocator(
    const std::shared_ptr<NPUAllocator>& allocator)
{
    TORCH_CHECK(!c10_npu::NPUCachingAllocator::allocator.load()->initialized(),
        "Can't swap an already initialized allocator");
    c10_npu::NPUCachingAllocator::allocator.store(allocator.get());
    current_custom_allocator = allocator;
}
```

## 3. NPUPluggableAllocator 实现细节

### 3.1 核心数据结构

```cpp
// NPUPluggableAllocator.h
struct _AllocationMetadata {
    size_t size;
    int device_idx;
    aclrtStream stream;  // 注意：只记录分配时的stream
};

struct NPUPluggableAllocator : public NPUAllocator {
protected:
    std::function<void*(size_t, int, aclrtStream)> alloc_fn_;
    std::function<void(void*, size_t, int, aclrtStream)> free_fn_;
    std::function<void(void*, c10_npu::NPUStream)> record_stream_fn_;  // 可选
    std::function<void(void*, c10_npu::NPUStream)> erase_stream_fn_;   // 可选
    std::unordered_map<void*, _AllocationMetadata> allocation_metadata_;
};
```

### 3.2 关键方法实现

#### recordStream 实现

```cpp
// NPUPluggableAllocator.cpp
void NPUPluggableAllocator::recordStream(
    const c10::DataPtr& ptr,
    streamType stream)
{
    if (record_stream_fn_) {
        record_stream_fn_(ptr.get(), stream);
    }
    // 如果没有设置 record_stream_fn_，这里什么都不做！
}
```

#### eraseStream 实现

```cpp
void NPUPluggableAllocator::eraseStream(
    const c10::DataPtr& ptr,
    streamType stream)
{
    if (erase_stream_fn_) {
        erase_stream_fn_(ptr.get(), stream);
    }
    // 如果没有设置 erase_stream_fn_，这里什么都不做！
}
```

#### 不支持的方法

```cpp
// 以下方法只打印警告，不做实际操作
void eraseStreamWithBlockPtr(void* block_ptr, NPUStream stream, void* work_ptr) {
    TORCH_NPU_WARN("NPUPluggableAllocator does not yet support eraseStreamWithBlockPtr.");
}

void* getBlockPtr(const c10::DataPtr& ptr) {
    TORCH_NPU_WARN("NPUPluggableAllocator does not yet support getBlockPtr.");
    return nullptr;
}

void recordHcclWorkForBlock(void* block_ptr, void* work_ptr) {
    TORCH_NPU_WARN("NPUPluggableAllocator does not yet support recordHcclWorkForBlock.");
}
```

## 4. recordStream 调用路径分析

### 4.1 完整调用链

```
ProcessGroupHCCL::collective()
    │
    │  c10_npu::NPUCachingAllocator::recordStream(inputs[i].storage().data_ptr(), hcclStream);
    │
    ▼
NPUCachingAllocator.h: recordStream()
    │
    │  inline void recordStream(const c10::DataPtr& ptr, NPUStream stream) {
    │      return get()->recordStream(ptr, stream);
    │  }
    │
    ▼
NPUCachingAllocator.h: get()
    │
    │  inline NPUAllocator* get() {
    │      return allocator.load();  // 返回全局 allocator 指针
    │  }
    │
    ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        分发到具体实现                                │
├─────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┤
│   默认分配器                 │   自定义分配器                         │
│   NpuCachingAllocator       │   NPUPluggableAllocator               │
├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
│   recordStream() {          │   recordStream() {                    │
│     Block* block = ...;     │     if (record_stream_fn_) {          │
│     block->stream_uses      │       record_stream_fn_(ptr, stream); │
│       .insert(stream);      │     }                                 │
│   }                         │   }                                   │
└─────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 4.2 时序图

```
时间线 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────►

1. 程序启动
   └─► BackendStaticInitializer 构造
       └─► allocator.store(&caching_allocator)  // 默认分配器

2. 用户调用 change_current_allocator(custom_allocator)
   └─► allocator.store(custom_allocator.get())  // 切换到自定义分配器

3. HCCL 通信时
   ProcessGroupHCCL::collective()
       │
       └─► c10_npu::NPUCachingAllocator::recordStream(ptr, hcclStream)
           │
           └─► get()->recordStream(ptr, stream)
               │
               └─► allocator.load()  // 返回 custom_allocator
                   │
                   └─► custom_allocator->recordStream(ptr, stream)
                       │
                       └─► if (record_stream_fn_) {
                               record_stream_fn_(ptr.get(), stream);
                           }
```

## 5. Python API 分析

### 5.1 当前 Python API 的局限性

```python
# torch_npu/npu/memory.py
class NPUPluggableAllocator(_NPUAllocator):
    def __init__(self, path_to_so_file: str, alloc_fn_name: str, free_fn_name: str):
        allocator = ctypes.CDLL(path_to_so_file)
        alloc_fn = ctypes.cast(getattr(allocator, alloc_fn_name), ctypes.c_void_p).value
        free_fn = ctypes.cast(getattr(allocator, free_fn_name), ctypes.c_void_p).value
        self._allocator = torch_npu._C._npu_customAllocator(alloc_fn, free_fn)
        # 问题：没有设置 record_stream_fn 和 erase_stream_fn！
```

**问题**：Python 层的 `NPUPluggableAllocator` 类只加载 `alloc_fn` 和 `free_fn`，完全没有提供设置 `record_stream_fn` 和 `erase_stream_fn` 的接口。

### 5.2 C++ 绑定层支持的接口

```cpp
// torch_npu/csrc/npu/Module.cpp
py::class_<NPUPluggableAllocator, ...>(m, "_NPUPluggableAllocator")
    .def("set_init_fn", ...)
    .def("set_reset_fn", ...)
    .def("set_memory_fraction_fn", ...)
    .def("set_base_alloc_fn", ...)
    .def("set_record_stream_fn", ...)      // ✅ C++ 层有绑定
    .def("set_erase_stream_fn", ...)       // ✅ C++ 层有绑定
    .def("set_get_device_stats_fn", ...)
    .def("set_reset_peak_status_fn", ...);
```

## 6. 使用自定义分配器的方法

### 6.1 方法一：使用当前 Python API（不支持 record_stream）

```python
from torch_npu.npu.memory import NPUPluggableAllocator, change_current_allocator

# 加载自定义分配器（只有 alloc 和 free）
allocator = NPUPluggableAllocator(
    "/path/to/my_allocator.so", 
    "my_alloc_fn",
    "my_free_fn"
)
change_current_allocator(allocator)

# 限制：record_stream 和 erase_stream 不会调用用户函数
```

### 6.2 方法二：直接使用 C++ 接口（完整支持）

```python
import ctypes
import torch_npu

# 1. 加载 so 文件
lib = ctypes.CDLL("/path/to/my_allocator.so")

# 2. 获取所有函数指针
alloc_fn = ctypes.cast(lib.my_alloc, ctypes.c_void_p).value
free_fn = ctypes.cast(lib.my_free, ctypes.c_void_p).value
record_stream_fn = ctypes.cast(lib.my_record_stream, ctypes.c_void_p).value
erase_stream_fn = ctypes.cast(lib.my_erase_stream, ctypes.c_void_p).value

# 3. 创建自定义分配器
allocator = torch_npu._C._npu_customAllocator(alloc_fn, free_fn)

# 4. 设置 record_stream 和 erase_stream 回调
allocator.set_record_stream_fn(record_stream_fn)
allocator.set_erase_stream_fn(erase_stream_fn)

# 5. 切换分配器（必须在初始化前调用）
torch_npu._C._npu_changeCurrentAllocator(allocator)
```

